  "overrides": {
    "uuid": "11.1.1"
  },
  "overridesComment": "DO NOT BUMP uuid PAST 11.x. Sequelize 6 does require(\"uuid\") in lib/utils.js; uuid 12+ is ESM-only (no `require` condition in its exports map), so a higher version kills the backend at boot with ERR_REQUIRE_ESM. 11.1.1 is the newest release that still ships CJS *and* carries the GHSA-w5hq-g745-h8pq fix. This override exists to patch that advisory without a Sequelize major upgrade. See sequelize#18224."
